===Notable losses===

====Defeat of the Honda Cabinet====
The 2026 election was unusually punishing to sitting cabinet ministers, with six of the sixteen members of the [[Second Honda Cabinet]] losing their constituencies to opposition challengers — a rate of ministerial defeat without precedent in modern Sanese electoral history. Political analysts attributed the concentrated losses to the Satori Blackout's tendency to focus voter anger on the specific ministers responsible for digital modernization policy, rather than distributing it evenly across the PPO.

